      "side": 1,
      "message": "Discussed with james and I decided against full versions.\n\nThe reason why is that if the driver version changed (which it can easily do) we MUST update these (which is a bit burdensome). It is more rare that the version changes and we get different features (many driver versions will hopefully be bug fixes)",
